# whatsapp-web.js session data — this is a live, authenticated WhatsApp session
# per gym (Puppeteer/Chromium profile under a real logged-in account). Treat it
# like a credential, not a cache: anyone with this folder can act as that
# WhatsApp number without ever scanning a QR code again. Never commit it.
.wwebjs_auth/
.wwebjs_cache/

